  "description": "Is your car’s air conditioning not cooling like it used to? A properly functioning AC system is essential for a comfortable drive, especially during warmer months. This service includes a full inspection to check for leaks, followed by a professional flush, vacuum, and refrigerant recharge if the system is sealed. It’s a simple way to bring back strong, consistent cooling performance.\n\nWhat we Offer\n\n  \n    AC Service Freon / Flush, Vacuum &amp; Recharge Freon R-134A (UP TO 1 LB)\n  \n  \n    R-1234yf AC Service, Flush, Vacuum &amp; Recharge (UP TO 1 LB)\n  \n\nWhy you should grab this Offer\nKeeping your car’s AC system in good condition is key to maintaining comfort on the road. This service not only recharges your refrigerant but also includes a flush and vacuum process to help your system run more efficiently. By checking for leaks first, it ensures the recharge is effective and long-lasting. Whether your vehicle uses R-134A or the newer R-1234yf, this service helps restore proper cooling performance and prevent future issues. It’s a practical and preventative maintenance step that can make a big difference, especially before the heat kicks in.",
